    "en": "A square pyramid of rusted iron cannonballs sits in a low stone frame on a paved terrace, with blue sea and sky behind it.",
    "zh": "铺石平台上，锈迹斑斑的铁炮弹在低矮的石框里堆成一座方锥形，背后是蓝色的大海和天空。"
  },
  "caption": {
    "en": "Cannonballs stacked in a pyramid, a packing of spheres in three dimensions, at Castillo San Felipe del Morro in San Juan, Puerto Rico, in October 2013. The photo does not show the packings in dimensions 8 and 24 that Viazovska's proofs concern.",
    "zh": "波多黎各圣胡安圣费利佩德尔莫罗城堡里堆成方锥形的炮弹，这是三维空间中的一种球堆积，摄于 2013 年 10 月。照片没有展示 Viazovska 的数学证明所涉及的 8 维和 24 维球堆积。"
  },
